            "created_at": "2025-09-19T02:22:25.90273+00:00",
            "notes": "This build is powerful, but *you* tend to be fragile, especially the first few rounds. Eventually with enough [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) you can dish out some damage, but you aren't built to tank a bunch of hits. \n\nPlay as far back and safe as you can while still hitting your whipshot and/or shield boomerangs. \n\n---\n\n### POWERS \n[Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8) can be a really fun power to mess with, especially with certain items/power combos, *however*, it's very easy to not get easy value out of it against certain teams. Barriers, including shields and bubbles, Mei walls, cleanses and flying heroes all either block the ability or make it extremely difficult to hit, especially as you'll be preferably trying to hit the ability from the longest range possible. \n\nIf you're not facing any of those things, then it's a great time to grab [Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8) first round! If not, especially if you have flying heroes to deal with, then [Maces to Faces](item_072c4780-53a1-4abd-9fc9-32406c3b7b49) is also a really fun power, and IME much more consistent. It also ends up with farther range than Shield Boomerang, which in turn will deal more damage. \n\n---\n\n### ITEMS \nFirst round doesn't matter as much, but just go with the selected items to give you a bit of [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) and armor.",
