            "notes": "Your gameplay doesn't change much into this round, most is the same but now you output more healing and [Ability Power](stat_ability_power)-based dmg for more cash in the next round. \n\n---\n\nBuilding up as much [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) as we realistically can, with a little [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction) for quicker cooldowns and thus more chance of higher inspire uptime.\n\nIf you're ever struggling to run from dives or other things trying to kill you, consider taking [Omni-Boots](item_632bd990-4523-4b3f-b08a-6dd11280c6f9) for ease of getting away.",
