            "notes": "You start to really be annoying this round as your constant debuff spam starts, and slowly build up more [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction) to hit people more often. \n\n---\n\n[Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) gives us debuffs for our burns, [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) and some [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction). This is everything we want! \n\nAlternatively, if you already have a teammate with [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) or [El-Sa'ka Supressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100), then [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) is another good debuff choice.",
