            "notes": "With both Shield Boomerang and long [Whip Shot](ability_b11d31d7-cf58-4e0d-8ec8-fbde3af5bb04) range, the enemies are gonna hate you a lot, now. \n\n---\n\n### POWERS\nTake either [Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8) or [Maces to Faces](item_072c4780-53a1-4abd-9fc9-32406c3b7b49) this round, whichever you didn't get round 1. Now you have *two* ways to burn people, in case you miss one. \n\n---\n\n### ITEMS\nWith [Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8), [Scavenged Steel](item_fb9d2d13-db05-46fa-b3c6-07495b1872a4) is an even more effective item for us, and will allow us to farm our ults pretty quick. Other than that, building up more [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction). \n\nIf you're worried about [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) and healing enough, however, then you can replace [Scavenged Steel](item_fb9d2d13-db05-46fa-b3c6-07495b1872a4) with [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4). \n\nAs you'll likely be dealing good ability damage due to your burns, [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) should also help you farm your ult pretty fast, though you'll be a *little* less tanky for it.",
