            "notes": "Stay safe, heal and apply debuffs. Get your ult quickly so when they're annoyed enough to go for you, you can rally in their face. :) \n\n---\n\nAdding [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) so they're slow now, too. \n\nIf someone on your team already has one of these debuffs constantly being applied because of their build, feel free to replace one or both items with something from the next round as to give yourself more room with your item slots. (Reminder: [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) and [El-Sa'ka Supressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100) do NOT stack, they count as the same debuff)",
