            "created_at": "2025-09-19T02:22:25.90273+00:00",
            "notes": "Enjoy as your full powers are here, and the enemies have to just deal with being on fire, slowed and take less healing pretty much all the time while you have a grand old time healing your team and getting rally fast. \n\n---\n\n### POWERS\nUsually I'd recommend getting [Consecrated Ground](item_fbdd3ee7-e527-4549-8dda-796c428270ee) to have even stronger ults, which you should be able to get pretty fast, but with the amount of ability damage you're outputting, [Aura Farming](item_b2416f42-1aa6-440a-8080-86290f5556c0) is also a good choice if you want to make you and your team tankier, or [Packstacker](item_87b99cde-3089-42fd-86bc-6e1ebf3fe422) if you want high healing uptime. \n\n---\n\n### ITEMS\nNow that we've taken [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e), there's several options for the last slot in our build - or you might have more than one, if you don't have both [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) and [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98). There are different pros and to each one and some cons:\n- [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce): High [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) for better healing and damage. Costs a lot, though. \n- [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8): Taking some DoT isn't as bad for Brigitte due to her passive self-healing through Inspire. Especially if you're dealing with enemies with big burst damage, this is a good survivability option. \n- [Dragons' Incinerator](item_d0794681-844b-4ce8-9857-15320f35a634): Longer rallys is good, and being tankier during it is great, but this doesn't help you when you're not actively using rally. \n- [Mitzi's Medicine](item_382d3dbd-63b8-453f-9be3-fefc3600dd24): Even if you don't activate the overhealth effect of this one, the direct buffs it gets you is great. This becomes **even better** if you took [Packstacker](item_87b99cde-3089-42fd-86bc-6e1ebf3fe422), as they synergize well. \n- [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6)/[Multi-tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56): The \"I'm broke\" options. At least they're still decent items.",
